及海面光点；添加流动星空纹理、海面波纹等细节；“09.17 农历八月十五”“月满中秋”“仰望星空 照亮每一条归途” 等文字，营造静谧浪漫、带有思乡氛围的 “月满中秋” 意境。 文生图提示词：中国传统皮影艺术风格，竖向构图。主体为身着带精美花纹传统服饰、衣带飘飘、手持道具似月下起舞的皮影嫦娥；旁有标注“农历·八月十五”的圆月，搭配云朵、带花纹的树木等元素；整体以暖黄色、棕色调为主，营造温馨古朴的中秋氛围；包含“月圆中秋”“但愿人长久·千里共婵娟”“团圆欢聚/阖家欢喜”等契合中秋主题的文字，字体设计具传统风格，突出中秋佳节古典意境与民俗文化韵味。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [384.6052551269531, 253.5965118408203], "pos": [152.5469512939453, 103.56861877441406], "id": 78, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "shape": 2, "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 110, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [570.8394165039062, 641.9031372070312], "pos": [1455.9842529296875, 63.19706726074219], "id": 60, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.48", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [107], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#232", "shape": 2, "widgets_values": [1024, 1536, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [306.2839050292969, 115.42439270019531], "pos": [231.1229248046875, 490.0882263183594], "id": 58, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.48", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentIma